# https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#dependency
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#dependency> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#dependency> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#dependency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#State> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#dependency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#State> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#dependency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expresses that two states are required together rather than as alternatives to one another."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#dependency> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "dependency"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#dependency> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Adopted from the VDI 3682 ODP of Helmut Schmidt University and not contained in the standard itself.\n\nUnder the open world assumption several inputs of one process operator always denote alternatives. Where inputs are required jointly, this has to be stated explicitly. The property acts as a conjunction between states, so that an expression such as \"A and B, or C and D\" becomes representable: dependency is asserted between A and B and between C and D.\n\nThe property complements ParallelFlow. A parallel flow qualifies a single connection, whereas dependency groups several connections into one conjunction."@en .
# 
