<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#hasAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a process operator to an assignment describing which technical resource realises it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#hasAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has assignment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#hasAssignment> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Directed counterpart of the usage symbol of VDI 3682 Part 1, Figure 3."@en .
