<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#hasInput> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a process operator to a state entering it. Inferred from the reified flows, not modelled directly."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#hasInput> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has input"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#hasInput> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "The chain reads: a flow leading to this operator originates from that state. Typed sub properties keep the inference from firing between two states or two operators."@en .
