<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#isAssignedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is assigned to"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#isAssignedTo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Shortcut across the reified assignment, provided so that queries need not traverse the reification. The VDI 3682 ODP of Helmut Schmidt University carries this property as the primary modelling construct."@en .
