<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Process> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A network describing a technical process. Its nodes are the states of products, energies and information, its directed edges are the transformation steps carried out by process operators."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Process> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Process"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#Process> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "VDI 3682 Part 1, Section 4.1. Part 2, Figure 2 constrains a process to exactly one system limit, at least one process operator and at least two states."@en .
