# https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#SystemLimit
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#SystemLimit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#SystemLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#TechnicalResource> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#SystemLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The boundary determining the observation horizon of a process. Under certain conditions it may also be regarded as a balance limit for incoming and outgoing products and energies."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#SystemLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "System Limit"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#SystemLimit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "VDI 3682 Part 1, Section 4.1. The system limit must not be used as a balance limit when alternative process runs are described."@en .
