# https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#TechnicalResource
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#TechnicalResource> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#TechnicalResource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A physical component of an automated plant that realises the transformation carried out by a process operator."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#TechnicalResource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Technical Resource"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#TechnicalResource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "VDI 3682 Part 1, Section 4.2. In the AIAS information model this class is the anchor for the elements of the automated plant, such as sensors, actuators, controllers and computing resources."@en .
